usage-perplexity-setting-cookie = perplexity.ai 网页会话。在 https://www.perplexity.ai 登录，打开开发者工具 → Application → Cookies → https://www.perplexity.ai，复制会话 Cookie（__Secure-next-auth.session-token，较新的登录为 __Secure-authjs.session-token），并按 "name=value" 格式粘贴。
usage-perplexity-setting-session-token = 也可以只填写该会话 Cookie 的值；会依次尝试每个会话 Cookie 名称。

usage-perplexity-credits = 额度
usage-perplexity-bonus-credits = 赠送额度
usage-perplexity-purchased-credits = 已购额度
usage-perplexity-used-of = { $used } / { $total }
usage-perplexity-bonus-expires = 赠送额度到期
